        <body>
            <div xml:id="d200">

                <pb facs="0199" n="187" xml:id="pg187"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">845.00/1783: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. William Phillips, Personal Representative of
                        President Roosevelt in India, to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New Delhi</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-02-10T11:00:00+06:30">February 10,
                            1943—11 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received February 10—3:44 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>120. The Viceroy has just informed me that Gandhi started his fast this morning
                    (my 118, February 9, 11 p.m.)</p>
                <p>Under the circumstances I am postponing any further tours for the time being.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
